A_PROGRAM_ARTIFACT 77

This file is the canonical semantic manifest for artifact version 77. The
artifact header carries the SHA-256 digest of these exact bytes. A reader must
reject a different version or digest before reading the interface. Version 75
is not accepted and has no compatibility parser. It persisted compiler-local
solver counters and effect-constraint snapshots instead of only accepted
semantic evidence and explicit residual verification contracts.

The header is followed by one immutable Intrinsic-environment contract:

intrinsic_environment FINGERPRINT DEFAULT_INTEGER_HOST_TYPE

FINGERPRINT is the deterministic 64-bit identity of namespace bindings, pure
primitive signatures, effect-operation signatures, and the default unsuffixed
integer representation. DEFAULT_INTEGER_HOST_TYPE must agree with that
fingerprint. Read and link reject an environment mismatch before interpreting
literal or primitive Claims. In the default environment, Int and Int32 name
HOST_TYPE_INT32 and unsuffixed integer literals have exactly that principal;
Int64 remains distinct. INT_LITERAL_ADMISSIBILITY is retained in the numeric
wire vocabulary only as a reserved historical ordinal and is not emitted or
accepted by the v77 compiler.

The artifact is one dense accepted object graph. Every section uses IDs in
0..count-1 with no holes. Solver candidates, work queues, HOTT actions,
bridges, certificates, normalization fuel, graph revisions, and closure ranks
are compiler-local and absent.

judgement_kind UNKNOWN=0 HAS_TYPE=1 IS_TYPE=2
judgement_authority INVALID=0 TYPED_OCCURRENCE=1 CONTEXT_BINDING=2 TYPE_DECLARATION=3 INTRINSIC=4 TYPE_FORMATION=5 UNIVERSE=6 CORE_HELPER=7 EXPORT=8
judgement_proof INVALID=0 TYPE_FORMATION_INTRO=1 CONSTRUCTOR_INTRO=2 CONSTRUCTOR_SPINE_FORMATION=3 BINDER_ASSUMPTION=4 MATCH_PATTERN_ASSUMPTION=5 LAMBDA_INTRO=6 APP_ELIM=7 RETURN_INTRO=8 THUNK_INTRO=9 FORCE_ELIM=10 OPERATION_REQUEST_INTRO=11 COMPUTATION_FOLD_ELIM=12 MATCH_TYPE_FORMATION_INTRO=13 MATCH_ELIM=14 SOLVED_MATCH_MOTIVE=15 INDUCTION_HYPOTHESIS_ELIM=16 TEXT_LITERAL_INTRO=17 PURE_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_INTRO=18 EFFECT_OPERATION_TYPE_INTRO=19 CONVERSION=20 EXPECTED_TYPE_EXPOSURE=21 TEXT_TYPE_INTRO=22 INT_LITERAL_INTRO=23 INT_LITERAL_ADMISSIBILITY=24 INT_TYPE_INTRO=25 HOST_TYPE_INTRO=26 IS_TYPE_FROM_HAS_TYPE=27 DECLARATION=28 UNIVERSE_CUMULATIVITY=29 PI_FORMATION_INTRO=30 CONTEXT_WEAKEN=31 EFFECT_WEAKEN=32 SUBSTITUTION_REINDEX=35 COMPUTATION_TYPE_FORMATION=43 THUNK_TYPE_FORMATION=44

Compiler-local relation-action proof kinds 33,34,36,37,38,39,40,41,42 are
not accepted wire proof kinds. SUBSTITUTION_REINDEX=35 is object evidence for
a Context/Substitution action and is intentionally retained.

term_tag VAR=1 CONSTRUCTOR=2 APP=3 LAMBDA=4 PI=5 MATCH=6 TYPE_FORMER=7 TYPE_DECLARATION=8 INDUCTION_HYPOTHESIS=9 UNIVERSE_VAR=10 PRIMITIVE_TEXT=11 TEXT_LITERAL=12 PRIMITIVE_INT=13 PRIMITIVE_INT64=14 INT_LITERAL=15 EXTERNAL_REF=16 PURE_PRIMITIVE=17 EFFECT_OPERATION=18 TYPE_VIEW=19 EFFECT_ROW_EMPTY=20 EFFECT_ROW_VAR=21 EFFECT_ROW_UNION=22 EFFECT_ROW_FORALL=23 COMPUTATION_TYPE=24 THUNK_TYPE=25 RETURN=26 THUNK=27 FORCE=28 OPERATION_REQUEST=29 COMPUTATION_FOLD=30 EFFECT_ROW_OPERATION=31

Compiler-local RELATION_TYPE_FORMER=32 and
RELATION_WITNESS_FORMER=33 are not accepted identity-root syntax.

type_origin SOURCE=0 GENERATED_IDENTITY=1
